 plugin adds \'Quick view\' buttons to your product tables (or elsewhere in your store). Customers can view extra information, images and add to the cart directly from a quick view lightbox.</p>\n<div class=\"barn2_promo_button-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://barn2.co.uk/wordpress-plugins/woocommerce-quick-view-pro/?utm_source=settings&#038;utm_content=wpt-wqv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Plugin</a></div></div><div class=\"barn2_promo_block\"><div class=\"barn2_promo_image_wrapper\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https://barn2.co.uk/wordpress-plugins/woocommerce-protected-categories/?utm_source=settings&#038;utm_content=wpt-wpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img width=\"350\" height=\"280\" src=\"https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-350x280.png\" class=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" =\"1\" srcset=\"https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-350x280.png 350w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-400x320.png 400w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-580x464.png 580w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-50x40.png 50w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-820x656.png 820w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-570x456.png 570w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-700x560.png 700w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories.png 1500w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Categories-400x320@2x.png 800w, https://mk0barn2t6l75xhh9gm.kinstacdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Protected-Ca