019-03-17 17:45:51','2019-03-17 21:45:51','Make some coffee. Put in in a mug. Drink that coffee. Now you\'re ready for whatever fresh hell today will bring.','Mug','It\'s a mug. For hot beverages.','publish','closed','closed','','mug','','','2021-03-16 23:58:58','2021-03-17 03:58:58','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=183',43,'product','',0),(184,1,'2019-03-17 17:46:34','2019-03-17 21:46:34','Great for keeping your coffee warm on your daily commute from your bed to your desk.','Metal Tumbler','Great for keeping your coffee warm on your daily commute from your bed to your desk.','publish','closed','closed','','metal-tumbler','','','2021-03-07 15:01:30','2021-03-07 20:01:30','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=184',42,'product','',0),(185,1,'2019-03-17 17:47:23','2019-03-17 21:47:23','Miss the office? Get the full experience by putting your cold sandwich and coconut water into our classic WRUW lunchbox, then walking the 20 feet to your couch to eat it.','Lunchbox','The WRUW lunchbox. You can store food in it.','publish','closed','closed','','lunchbox','','','2021-03-16 23:58:39','2021-03-17 03:58:39','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=185',44,'product','',0),(186,1,'2019-03-17 17:51:43','2019-03-17 21:51:43','Miss the bar? Get the full bar experience at home! Get a can of your favorite frosty beverage and pour directly into your crotch. Then get another one to add to this glass. It\'ll feel just like your favorite bar.\r\n\r\nBeer not included this year, unfortunately. Maybe next year.','Pint Glass','A classic, the WRUW pint glass. Beer not included, this year.','publish','closed','closed','','pint-glass','','','2021-03-07 14:57:03','2021-03-07 19:57:03','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=186',14,'product','',0),(187,1,'2019-03-17 21:51:25','2019-03-17 21:51:25','','pint_glass','','inherit','open','closed','','pint_glass-2','','','2019-03-17 21:51:25','2019-03-17 21:51:25','',186,'https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/pint_glass-1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(188,1,'2019-03-17 17:53:27','2019-03-17 21:53:27','Connect to your phone and listen to your favorite station without wires! We are truly in the future. Available in limited quantities.','Bluetooth Speaker','','trash','closed','closed','','bluetooth-speaker__trashed','','','2021-03-07 14:53:17','2021-03-07 19:53:17','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=188',22,'product','',0),(189,1,'2019-03-17 21:56:14','2019-03-17 21:56:14','Let our staff pick four CD\'s for you to enjoy. We pick based around the show you select at checkout.','4 CD Exploration pack','4 CD\'s picked out by our experts in the genre of your choice.','publish','closed','closed','','4-cd-exploration-pack','','','2021-03-17 12:10:18','2021-03-17 16:10:18','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=189',18,'product','',0),(190,1,'2019-03-17 21:56:30','2019-03-17 21:56:30','Let our staff pick ten CD\'s for you to enjoy. We pick based around the show you select at checkout.','10 CD Exploration pack','10 CD\'s picked out by our experts in the genre of your choice.','publish','closed','closed','','10-cd-exploration-pack','','','2021-03-17 12:10:10','2021-03-17 16:10:10','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=190',17,'product','',0),(196,1,'2019-03-17 22:13:04','2019-03-17 22:13:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This year, we are introducing an open house and premium pick-up party in coordination with the Jolly Scholar. This is your opportunity to meet your favorite station members and get a tour of the station. Plus free food and a free drink (any draft beer, well drink, or milkshake) for anyone that donates over $25! So come on down and party with your favorite college radio station in Cleveland Ohio that has the frequency 91.1.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When?</strong> May 4th<br><strong>Where? </strong>Thwing Atrium and Jolly Scholar<br><strong>What time?</strong> 12 PM - 6 PM. The Jolly Scholar is open until 2 AM if you want to continue partying after the official event is over<br><strong>Do I have to donate to attend?</strong> No! Though in order to get free food and a drink on us, you must donate at least $25.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Street parking is available along Bellflower Road and East Ave (free on weekends), and garage parking is available in <a href=\"https://www.universitycircle.org/destinations/lot-29\">Lot 29</a> ($2.00/hour)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Premium Pickup Party','','publish','closed','closed','','premium-pickup-party','','','2019-04-24 11:24:19','2019-04-24 15:24:19','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?page_id=196',0,'page','',0),(197,1,'2019-03-17 22:13:04','2019-03-17 22:13:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This year, we are introducing an open house and premium pick-up party in coordination with the Jolly Scholar. This is your opportunity to meet your favorite station members and get a tour of the station. Plus free food and a free drink (any draft beer, well drink, or milkshake) for anyone that donates over $25! So come on down and party with your favorite college radio station in Cleveland Ohio that has the frequency 91.1.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When?</strong> May 4th<br><strong>Where? </strong>Thwing Atrium and Jolly Scholar<br><strong>What time?</strong> 12 PM - 6 PM. The Jolly Scholar is open until 2 AM if you want to continue partying after the official event is over<br><strong>Do I have to donate to attend?</strong> No! Though in order to get free food and a drink on us, you must donate at least $25.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Premium Pickup Party','','inherit','closed','closed','','196-revision-v1','','','2019-03-17 22:13:04','2019-03-17 22:13:04','',196,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/2019/03/17/196-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(198,1,'2019-03-18 15:50:19','2019-03-18 15:50:19',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','198','','','2021-03-07 14:31:05','2021-03-07 19:31:05','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?p=198',4,'nav_menu_item','',0),(202,1,'2019-03-18 11:51:49','2019-03-18 15:51:49','','2019 Telethon Shirt - S','Size: S','publish','closed','closed','','2019-telethon-shirt-s','','','2021-03-16 23:57:29','2021-03-17 03:57:29','',86,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/product/2019-telethon-shirt/',1,'product_variation','',0),(203,1,'2019-03-18 11:51:49','2019-03-18 15:51:49','','2019 Telethon Shirt - M','Size: M','publish','closed','closed','','2019-telethon-shirt-m','','','2021-03-16 23:57:29','2021-03-17 03:57:29','',86,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/product/2019-telethon-shirt/',2,'product_variation','',0),(205,1,'2019-03-18 11:51:49','2019-03-18 15:51:49','','2019 Telethon Shirt - XL','Size: XL','publish','closed','closed','','2019-telethon-shirt-xl','','','2021-03-16 23:57:52','2021-03-17 03:57:52','',86,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/product/2019-telethon-shirt/',4,'product_variation','',0),(206,1,'2019-03-18 11:51:50','2019-03-18 15:51:50','','2019 Telethon Shirt - 2XL','Size: 2XL','publish','closed','closed','','2019-telethon-shirt-2xl','','','2021-03-16 23:57:52','2021-03-17 03:57:52','',86,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/product/2019-telethon-shirt/',5,'product_variation','',0),(207,1,'2019-03-18 11:51:50','2019-03-18 15:51:50','','2019 Telethon Shirt - 3XL','Size: 3XL','publish','closed','closed','','2019-telethon-shirt-3xl','','','2021-03-16 23:57:52','2021-03-17 03:57:52','',86,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/product/2019-telethon-shirt/',6,'product_variation','',0),(208,1,'2019-03-18 15:53:37','2019-03-18 15:53:37','<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5807,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/WebsitePreTELETHON-websute-1024x587.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5807\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"thermo\" class=\"thermometer horizontal\">\n\n        <div class=\"track\">\n            <div class=\"goal\">\n                <div class=\"amount\"> </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"progress\">\n                <div class=\"amount\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.3.1.min.js\" integrity=\"sha256-FgpCb/KJQlLNfOu91ta32o/NMZxltwRo8QtmkMRdAu8=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script>\n\nfunction formatCurrency(n, c, d, t) {\n    \"use strict\";\n\n    var s, i, j;\n\n    c = isNaN(c = Math.abs(c)) ? 2 : c;\n    d = d === undefined ? \".\" : d;\n    t = t === undefined ? \",\" : t;\n\n    s = n < 0 ? \"-\" : \"\";\n    i = parseInt(n = Math.abs(+n || 0).toFixed(c), 10) + \"\";\n    j = (j = i.length) > 3 ? j % 3 : 0;\n\n    return s + (j ? i.substr(0, j) + t : \"\") + i.substr(j).replace(/(\\d{3})(?=\\d)/g, \"$1\" + t) + (c ? d + Math.abs(n - i).toFixed(c).slice(2) : \"\");\n}\n\n\nfunction thermometer(id, goalAmount, progressAmount, animate) {\n    \"use strict\";\n\n    var $thermo = $(\"#\"+id),\n        $progress = $(\".progress\", $thermo),\n        $goal = $(\".goal\", $thermo),\n        percentageAmount,\n        isHorizontal = $thermo.hasClass(\"horizontal\"),\n        newCSS = {};\n\n    goalAmount = goalAmount || parseFloat( $goal.text() ),\n    progressAmount = progressAmount || parseFloat( $progress.text() ),\n    percentageAmount =  Math.min( Math.round(progressAmount / goalAmount * 1000) / 10, 100); //make sure we have 1 decimal point\n\n    //let\'s format the numbers and put them back in the DOM\n    $goal.find(\".amount\").text( \"$\" + formatCurrency( goalAmount ) );\n    $progress.find(\".amount\").text( \"$\" + formatCurrency( progressAmount ) );\n\n\n    //let\'s set the progress indicator\n    $progress.find(\".amount\").hide();\n\n    newCSS[ isHorizontal ? \"width\" : \"height\" ] = percentageAmount + \"%\";\n\n    if (animate !== false) {\n        $progress.animate( newCSS, 1200, function(){\n            $(this).find(\".amount\").fadeIn(500);\n        });\n    }\n    else {\n        $progress.css( newCSS );\n        $progress.find(\".amount\").fadeIn(500);\n    }\n}\n$(document).ready(function(){\n    thermometer(\"thermo\", 65000, total );\n});\n\n</script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\">Welcome to the 2021 WRUW Telethon!</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We don\'t need to say that this past year has been rough, and as we try to get back to normal operations, we are asking for your help to make that possible. Don\'t feel obliged to give if you are unable, but if can support us and want to help us continue our mission of brining different music to the airwaves of Cleveland, you can donate below (plus you can get some cool swag in the process).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[product_table category=\"2021_premiums\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2021-03-10 21:04:48','2021-03-11 02:04:48','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?page_id=208',0,'page','',0),(209,1,'2019-03-18 15:53:37','2019-03-18 15:53:37','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 WRUW Telethon page</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','208-revision-v1','','','2019-03-18 15:53:37','2019-03-18 15:53:37','',208,'https://telethon.wruw.org/index.php/2019/03/18/208-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(213,1,'2019-03-18 16:50:07','2019-03-18 16:50:07','a:7:{s:8:\"location\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"param\";s:13:\"post_template\";s:8:\"operator\";s:2:\"==\";s:5:\"value\";s:17:\"template-show.php\";}}}s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"normal\";s:5:\"style\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"label_placement\";s:3:\"top\";s:21:\"instruction_placement\"