.org/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sample Page','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:26','2019-03-29 12:39:26','',2,'https://telethon.wruw.org/2-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2558,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:26','2019-03-29 12:39:26','','Shop','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:26','2019-03-29 12:39:26','',5,'https://telethon.wruw.org/5-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2559,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:26','2019-03-29 12:39:26','','Solitude','','inherit','closed','closed','','507-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:26','2019-03-29 12:39:26','',507,'https://telethon.wruw.org/507-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2560,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','','Soy Milk & Fried Dough','','inherit','closed','closed','','509-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','',509,'https://telethon.wruw.org/509-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2561,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','','stonecoldbikini','','inherit','closed','closed','','510-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','',510,'https://telethon.wruw.org/510-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2562,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','','Sunny Day','','inherit','closed','closed','','512-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','',512,'https://telethon.wruw.org/512-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2563,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','','Survey Class','','inherit','closed','closed','','513-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','',513,'https://telethon.wruw.org/513-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2564,1,'2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','','Sweet and Lowdown','','inherit','closed','closed','','514-revision-v1','','','2019-03-29 12:39:27','2019-03-29 12:39:27','',514,'https://telethon.wruw.org/514-revision-v1/',0,'rev