es On Wax, Xploding Plastix, and loads of heavy Dub! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Exclusive Premium: Musik For Film</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[bandcamp width=100% height=120 album=573501305 size=large bgcol=333333 linkcol=ffffff tracklist=false artwork=small]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Musik For Film features \"Downtempo\" from many of the genres premier artists including: Rootz &amp; Zeebo of Thievery Corporation (See-I), Rick Torres of the Supreme Beings Of Leisure and Bitter:Sweet (Lazy), Portishead Trip Hop contemporaries Sin, Jamie Saft of John Zorn\'s Masada, Professor Oz featuring Sugar B of Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister fame, and NuJazz pioneers Xploding Plastix, among 17 heavy hitters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> \"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation on Burning Bowl Records. This cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan…great stuff!!\" <br></p><cite>Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Passport with host Architektur | </strong><em><strong>Playlists, Interviews, More:</strong></em><strong> </strong><a href=\"http://www.loungeproductions.com/passport-radio.html\">http://www.loungeproductions.com/passport-radio.html</a> </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow aligncenter\" data-effect=\"slide\"><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_container swiper-container\"><ul class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_swiper-wrappper swiper-wrapper\"><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2589\" data-id=\"2589\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Passport_2018c.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block