9/03/tumbler.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><a href=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/product/metal-tumbler/\">Metal Tumbler</a></td><td>$75</td></tr><tr><td><img class=\"wp-image-180\" style=\"width: 150px;\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/tiki_front.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><a href=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/product/tiki-glass/\">Tiki Glass</a></td><td>$25</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','208-revision-v1','','','2019-04-02 15:28:31','2019-04-02 19:28:31','',208,'https://telethon.wruw.org/208-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2688,1,'2021-03-07 14:49:13','2021-03-07 19:49:13','','','<p><br data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p>','trash','closed','closed','','__trashed','','','2021-03-07 14:49:13','2021-03-07 19:49:13','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=product&#038;p=2688',1,'product','',0),(2689,67,'2019-04-02 15:32:44','2019-04-02 19:32:44','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Passport Radio | Featuring The Finest In Downbeat &amp; Dub!</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2584} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/newpassportlogo3g-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2584\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Est. 2003. ​The premier \"Downtempo\" radio program broadcasting Saturdays on WRUW 91.1FM with host Architektur. ​Passport features carefully crafted programming….a deep, fluid soundtrack to complement your life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Passport plays: Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister, Gotan Project, Massive Attack, Sofa Surfers, Thievery Corporation, Yonderboi, Tosca, Nightmares On Wax, Xploding Plastix, Portishead, and loads of heavy Dub!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Exclusive Premium: Musik For Film</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[bandcamp width=100% height=120 album=573501305 size=large bgcol=333333 linkcol=ffffff tracklist=false artwork=small]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Musik For Film</strong> features \"Downtempo\" from many of the genres premier artists including: Rootz &amp; Zeebo of Thievery Corporation (See-I), Rick Torres of the Supreme Beings Of Leisure and Bitter:Sweet (Lazy), Portishead Trip Hop contemporaries Sin, Jamie Saft of John Zorn\'s Masada, Professor Oz featuring Sugar B of Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister fame, and NuJazz pioneers Xploding Plastix, among 17 heavy hitters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> \"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation on Burning Bowl Records. This cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan…great stuff!!\" <br></p><cite>Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow aligncenter\" data-effect=\"slide\"><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_container swiper-container\"><ul class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_swiper-wrappper swiper-wrapper\"><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2589\" data-id=\"2589\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Passport_2018c.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Passport Radio ~ Saturdays 2-4PM | 24/7 on WRUW 91.1FM!</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2590\" data-id=\"2590\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chill001.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Est. 2003. ​The premier \"Downtempo\" radio program with host Architektur. </figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2587\" data-id=\"2587\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chillinviennasnow1.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation...this cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan...great stuff!!\" Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2591\" data-id=\"2591\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chill002.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"DJ Architektur played the dreamiest, trippiest music I\'d heard in many moons.\" Stephen MacMillan Moser | Austin Chronicle</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2612\" data-id=\"2612\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/newpassportlogo4b.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"We luxuriated in the European-style blends...Drinks. Chats. Downbeats. Exhilarating!\" ​Michael Barnes | Austin Statesman</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2586\" data-id=\"2586\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/MA19.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">​Passport features carefully crafted programming...a deep, fluid soundtrack to complement your life.</figcaption></figure></li></ul><a class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-prev swiper-button-prev swiper-button-white\" role=\"button\"></a><a class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-next swiper-button-next swiper-button-white\" role=\"button\"></a><a aria-label=\"Pause Slideshow\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-pause\" role=\"button\"></a><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_pagination swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-white\"></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Playlists, Interviews, More: </strong><a href=\"http://www.loungeproductions.com/passport-radio.html \">http://www.loungeproductions.com/passport-radio.html </a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/youtube {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/LaOe3u2uiME\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-youtube wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/LaOe3u2uiME\n</div><figcaption><strong>Saturdays 2-4PM | 24/7 on WRUW 91.1FM:</strong> <a href=\"https://wruw.org/show/passport/\">https://wruw.org/show/passport/</a></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/youtube -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Many thanks for your support!</p><cite>Architektur</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->','Passport','','inherit','closed','closed','','490-revision-v1','','','2019-04-02 15:32:44','2019-04-02 19:32:44','',490,'https://telethon.wruw.org/490-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2693,68,'2019-04-02 20:55:03','2019-04-03 00:55:03','','Laying Down Tracks','','inherit','closed','closed','','475-revision-v1','','','2019-04-02 20:55:03','2019-04-03 00:55:03','',475,'https://telethon.wruw.org/475-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2699,1,'2019-04-03 15:16:19','2019-04-03 19:16:19','',