4-05 12:42:54','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hello! Please consider donating to my show, Sunny Day! :)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sunny Day','','inherit','closed','closed','','512-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 08:42:54','2019-04-05 12:42:54','',512,'https://telethon.wruw.org/512-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2758,75,'2019-04-05 11:55:04','2019-04-05 15:55:04','','Sweet and Lowdown','','inherit','closed','closed','','514-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 11:55:04','2019-04-05 15:55:04','',514,'https://telethon.wruw.org/514-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2760,75,'2019-04-05 11:57:38','2019-04-05 15:57:38','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s time for Telethon,  and here at Sweet &amp; Lowdown (and at WRUW), we\'ve set our most ambitious fundraising goal yet! Your donation goes directly towards supporting our noncommercial, nonprofit station, and enables us to acquire new music, put on concerts and events, repair and replace our equipment, and do everything else needed to keep the station sounding great.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"https://www.theshedd.org/uh/scaleimage.ashx?id=29&amp;width=676\" alt=\"\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Sweet and Lowdown','','inherit','closed','closed','','514-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 11:57:38','2019-04-05 15:57:38','',514,'https://telethon.wruw.org/514-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2761,75,'2019-04-05 14:30:10','2019-04-05 18:30:10','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s time for Telethon, yet again, and we\'re ready to shoot for the stars this year with Sweet &amp; Lowdown\'s (and WRUW\'s) most ambitious fundraising goal yet. All money goes directly towards helping WRUW bring you more and better music and events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"https://www.theshedd.org/uh/scaleimage.ashx?id=29&amp;width=676\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Sweet and Lowdown','','inherit','closed','closed','','514-autosave-v1','','','2019-04-05 14:30:10','2019-04-05 18:30:10','',514,'https://telethon.wruw.org/514-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2767,55,'2019-04-05 17:15:41','2019-04-05 21:15:41','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:15:41','2019-04-05 21:15:41','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2768,55,'2019-04-05 17:15:42','2019-04-05 21:15:42','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:15:42','2019-04-05 21:15:42','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2769,55,'2019-04-05 17:15:59','2019-04-05 21:15:59','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:15:59','2019-04-05 21:15:59','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2770,55,'2019-04-05 17:16:22','2019-04-05 21:16:22','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:16:22','2019-04-05 21:16:22','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2772,55,'2019-04-05 17:16:29','2019-04-05 21:16:29','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:16:29','2019-04-05 21:16:29','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2773,55,'2019-04-05 17:17:15','2019-04-05 21:17:15','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:17:15','2019-04-05 21:17:15','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2774,55,'2019-04-05 17:17:56','2019-04-05 21:17:56','','NYGCM','','inherit','closed','closed','','nygcm','','','2019-04-05 17:17:56','2019-04-05 21:17:56','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/NYGCM.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2775,55,'2019-04-05 17:19:50','2019-04-05 21:19:50','','NYGCM','','inherit','closed','closed','','nygcm-2','','','2019-04-05 17:19:50','2019-04-05 21:19:50','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/NYGCM-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2776,55,'2019-04-05 17:21:50','2019-04-05 21:21:50','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! You are invited to contribute to WRUW and to help keep this program thriving and engaging. NYGCM airs every Monday afternoon on 91.1 FM, and brings you classical music you won\'t hear on mainstream radio. Keep listening!  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>~ Eric Charnofsky</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:21:50','2019-04-05 21:21:50','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2777,55,'2019-04-05 17:22:26','2019-04-05 21:22:26','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to the 2019 telethon page for Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music! You are invited to contribute to WRUW and to help keep this program thriving and engaging. NYGCM airs every Monday afternoon on 91.1 FM, and brings you classical music you won\'t hear on mainstream radio. Keep listening, and thank you for your generous donation!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>~ Eric Charnofsky</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Not Your Grandmother\'s Classical Music','','inherit','closed','closed','','487-revision-v1','','','2019-04-05 17:22:26','2019-04-05 21:22:26','',487,'https://telethon.wruw.org/487-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2782,112,'2019-04-06 14:35:32','2019-04-06 18:35:32','','Fat Monday Logo','','inherit','closed','closed','','fat-monday-logo','','','2019-04-06 14:35:32','2019-04-06 18:35:32','',465,'https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/Fat-Monday-Logo.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2785,112,'2019-04-06 14:59:40','2019-04-06 18:59:40','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>   WRUW has a long and proud history presenting the music of New Orleans and Louisiana.  In past years you could hear it on \"When the Roses Bloom Again\" with Cuzin Dave, \"Annie\'s Blues Show\" with Ann Weatherhead, , \"Rhythm &amp; Blues Survey\" &amp; \"Blue Monday\" with Walking Dr. Bill Anderson and \"Chanka Chank\" with Alison Kaslow Minor (One of the people responsible for starting the New Orleans Jazz &amp; Heritage Festival) as well as other shows.   I have learned to love this music from these programmers and Ron Cass who started \"Fat Monday.\"  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your help during the 2019 WRUW Telethon will enable us to continue this tradition by adding even more music, both old and new to contine presenting the great music to our listenres. new</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Fat Monday','','inherit','closed','closed','','465-revision-v1','','','2019-04-06 14:59:40','2019-04-06 18:59:40','',465,'https://telethon.wruw.org/465-revision-v