} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-drop-cap has-very-dark-gray-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-background-color\">If you enjoy listing to Laying Down Tracks (\"Country Music; roots and branches--and sometimes we go out on a limb\") on Thursday nights, please consider showing your financial support for our endeavors by calling 216-368-2208 or contributing online.  We have an excellent lineup of premium gifts--CDs and WRUW-branded merch--in exchange for your donations... Thanks! Your host, Mr. JEG</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Laying Down Tracks','','inherit','closed','closed','','475-revision-v1','','','2019-04-08 15:32:50','2019-04-08 19:32:50','',475,'https://telethon.wruw.org/475-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3707,14,'2019-04-08 15:44:04','2019-04-08 19:44:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi, this is Neal, your host\nof Dare Waves.&nbsp; Dare Waves is one of WRUW’s\nlongest running shows; every week I strive to put on quality programming, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Playing old and new music</li><li>Music from all sources – vinyl (45s, LPs, 12”), CDs,\nmusic from the WRUW digital library, even cassettes</li><li>Music from *my* personal collection – the Dare Waves vault,\nas I like to call it</li><li>Local music as well as national and international\nbands</li><li>Compilations, soundtracks, and tributes</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>51 weeks of the year I am\nhere for *you* – presenting the best program I can, playing your requests,\nhaving numerous ticket giveaways for live concerts, movies, and other special\nevents, and in general trying my best to program the best “Dare Waves” that I\ncan. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the week I need you\nto be here for me!&nbsp; Please call 216.368.2208\nor donate online at telethon.wruw.org (and direct your donation to Dare Waves).&nbsp; Please support this long-running labor of love\nprogram “Dare Waves” and let me thank you with a gift (either music or WRUW\nmerchandise that you can’t get anywhere else).&nbsp;\nThank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if you have already donated\nto Dare Waves – Thank You!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','DareWaves','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2019-04-08 15:44:04','2019-04-08 19:44:04','',451,'https://telethon.wruw.org/451-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3708,14,'2019-04-08 15:44:06','2019-04-08 19:44:06','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi, this is Neal, your host\nof Dare Waves.&nbsp; Dare Waves is one of WRUW’s\nlongest running shows; every week I strive to put on quality programming, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Playing old and new music</li><li>Music from all sources – vinyl (45s, LPs, 12”), CDs,\nmusic from the WRUW digital library, even cassettes</li><li>Music from *my* personal collection – the Dare Waves vault,\nas I like to call it</li><li>Local music as well as national and international\nbands</li><li>Compilations, soundtracks, and tributes</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>51 weeks of the year I am\nhere for *you* – presenting the best program I can, playing your requests,\nhaving numerous ticket giveaways for live concerts, movies, and other special\nevents, and in general trying my best to program the best “Dare Waves” that I\ncan. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the week I need you\nto be here for me!&nbsp; Please call 216.368.2208\nor donate online at telethon.wruw.org (and direct your donation to Dare Waves).&nbsp; Please support this long-running labor of love\nprogram “Dare Waves” and let me thank you with a gift (either music or WRUW\nmerchandise that you can’t get anywhere else).&nbsp;\nThank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if you have already donated\nto Dare Waves – Thank You!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','DareWaves','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2019-04-08 15:44:06','2019-04-08 19:44:06','',451,'https://telethon.wruw.org/451-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3719,1,'2019-04-08 16:34:04','2019-04-08 20:34:04','','Order &ndash; April 8, 2019 @ 04:34 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_89bJ7JINGOcO3','order-apr-08-2019-0834-pm','','','2019-04-08 16:35:44','2019-04-08 20:35:44','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3719',0,'shop_order','',2),(3722,85,'2019-04-08 16:39:01','2019-04-08 20:39:01','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hey there. The 2019 WRUW Telethon is\nhere!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Donate to your favorite WRUW show(s) by\nclicking the “make a donation” link above, or by calling\n216.368.2208. You can check out this year\'s premiums from the menus\nabove. As always, we have some really unique WRUW gear that isn\'t\navailable anywhere else. Support WRUW and the wonderful independence\nof college radio. Support independent music. Support independent art.\nSupport independent thought.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Matt @ Aware Of The Plan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Aware of the Plan','','inherit','closed','closed','','444-revision-v1','','','2019-04-08 16:39:01','2019-04-08 20:39:01','',444,'https://telethon.wruw.org/444-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3723,85,'2019-04-08 16:39:04','2019-04-08 20:39:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hey there. The 2019 WRUW Telethon is\nhere!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Donate to your favorite WRUW show(s) by\nclicking the “make a donation” link above, or by calling\n216.368.2208. You can check out this year\'s premiums from the menus\nabove. As always, we have some really unique WRUW gear that isn\'t\navailable anywhere else. Support WRUW and the wonderful independence\nof co