 include sold-out or high ticket price events. Dollar amount valued at $40-$70.','Guilty Pleasures - Pair of tickets to Agora Theater','<p><br data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p>','inherit','closed','closed','','3632-autosave-v1','','','2019-04-08 17:17:59','2019-04-08 21:17:59','',3632,'https://telethon.wruw.org/3632-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3729,1,'2019-04-08 17:18:35','2019-04-08 21:18:35','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"dropCap\":true,\"textColor\":\"very-dark-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-amber\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-drop-cap has-very-dark-gray-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-background-color\">If you enjoy listing to Laying Down Tracks (\"Country Music; roots and branches--and sometimes we go out on a limb\") on Thursday nights, please consider showing your financial support for our endeavors by calling 216-368-2208 or contributing online.  We have an excellent lineup of premium gifts--CDs and WRUW-branded merch--in exchange for your donations... Thanks! Your host, Mr. JEG</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Laying Down Tracks','','inherit','closed','closed','','475-revision-v1','','','2019-04-08 17:18:35','2019-04-08 21:18:35','',475,'https://telethon.wruw.org/475-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3730,1,'2019-04-08 17:23:14','2019-04-08 21:23:14','','Order &ndash; April 8, 2019 @ 05:23 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_9VPZrMllTKgkU','order-apr-08-2019-0923-pm','','','2019-04-08 17:24:09','2019-04-08 21:24:09','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3730',0,'shop_order','',3),(3731,1,'2019-04-08 17:23:16','2019-04-08 21:23:16','Get the 2019 Telethon shirt and two more shirts from our archive of past Telethon shirts! Sizes will be identical, but designs are not guaranteed.','2019 Telethon Shirt 3 pack (includes 2 mystery shirts)','<p><br data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p>','inherit','closed','closed','','158-autosave-v1','','','2019-04-08 17:23:16',