-04-09 13:59:58','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3853',0,'shop_order','',2),(3854,1,'2019-04-09 09:56:55','2019-04-09 13:56:55','','Order &ndash; April 9, 2019 @ 09:56 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_P9OF6VrnlNx4U','order-apr-09-2019-0156-pm-2','','','2019-04-09 09:59:10','2019-04-09 13:59:10','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3854',0,'shop_order','',2),(3855,73,'2019-04-09 09:57:01','2019-04-09 13:57:01','<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Calling all hipsters past and present!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">It’s time to show how much you LOVE community/college radio in Cleveland AND the Aging Hipster Blues radio program!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Donate now to the Aging Hipster Blues radio program. My goal is for $500 this year. I have 2 great premiums for a couple of donors and other awesome incentives for your tax deductible donation!!</p>\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','My account','','inherit','closed','closed','','8-revision-v1','','','2019-04-09 09:57:01','2019-04-09 13:57:01','',8,'https://telethon.wruw.org/8-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3856,1,'2019-04-09 09:59:01','2019-04-09 13:59:01','','Order &ndash; April 9, 2019 @ 09:59 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_8ITKn8QhLJiz8','order-apr-09-2019-0159-pm','','','2019-04-09 10:01:54','2019-04-09 14:01:54','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3856',0,'shop_order','',2),(3857,1,'2019-04-09 10:07:26','2019-04-09 14:07:26','','Order &ndash; April 9, 2019 @ 10:07 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_ANj5FjkSzeLYU','order-apr-09-2019-0207-pm','','','2019-04-09 10:08:55','2019-04-09 14:08:55','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3857',0,'shop_order','',3),(3861,1,'2019-04-09 10:08:44','2019-04-09 14:08:44','','Order &ndash; April 9, 2019 @ 10:08 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_ywt9xxl7jcAzd','order-apr-09-2019-0208-pm-2','','','2019-06-29 11:19:09','2019-06-29 15:19:09','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3861',0,'shop_order','',3),(3862,14,'2019-04-09 10:08:56','2019-04-09 14:08:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi, this is Neal, your host\nof Dare Waves.&nbsp; Dare Waves is one of WRUW’s\nlongest running shows; every week I strive to put on quality programming, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Playing old and new music</li><li>Music from all sources – vinyl (45s, LPs, 12”), CDs,\nmusic from the WRUW digital library, even cassettes</li><li>Music from *my* personal collection – the Dare Waves vault,\nas I like to call it</li><li>Local music as well as national and international\nbands</li><li>Compilations, soundtracks, and tributes</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>51 weeks of the year I am\nhere for *you* – presenting the best program I can, playing your requests,\nhaving numerous ticket giveaways for live concerts, movies, and other special\nevents, and in general trying my best to program the best “Dare Waves” that I\ncan. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the week I need you to be here for me!  Please call 216.368.2208 or donate online at telethon.wruw.org (and direct your donation to Dare Waves).  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dare Waves has a bonus for the most generous donor - if *you* make the largest donation to Dare Waves during the show, in addition to the premiums you select, Neal will toss in a pair of tickets for Robyn Hitchcock at the Music Box Supper Club on Wed June  19!!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please support this long-running program “Dare Waves” and let me thank you with a gift (either music or WRUW merchandise that you can’t get anywhere else).  Thank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if you have already donated\nto Dare Waves – Thank You!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','DareWaves','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2019-04-09 10:08:56','2019-04-09 14:08:56','',451,'https://telethon.wruw.org/451-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3863,1,'2019-04-09 10:09:58','2019-04-09 14:09:58','','Order &ndash; April 9, 2019 @ 10:09 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_nnV3AjRoJwqnv','order-apr-09-2019-0216-pm','','','2019-04-22 09:23:52','2019-04-22 13:23:52','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3863',0,'shop_order','',3),(3864,73,'2019-04-09 10:18:32','2019-04-09 14:18:32','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks for being a loyal listener to the Aging Hipster Blues radio program!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calling all hipsters past and present—Please help me reach my goal of $500. I have 2 great premiums that are sure to be snatched up quickly BUT there’s a bunch of awesome premiums with WRUW logo items, CD’s etc that I am sure you’ll find something that interests you for a premium as a thank you for your donation. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Aging Hipster Blues','','inherit','closed','closed','','440-revision-v1','','','2019-04-09 10:18:32','2019-04-09 14:18:32','',440,'https://telethon.wruw.org/440-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3865,73,'2019-04-09 10:18:34','2019-04-09 14:18:34','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks for being a loyal listener to the Aging Hipster Blues radio program!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calling all hipsters past and present—Please help me reach my goal of $500. I have 2 great premiums that are sure to be snatched up quickly BUT there’s a bunch of awesome premiums with WRUW logo items, CD’s etc that I am sure you’ll find something that interests you for a premium as a thank you for your donation. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Aging Hipster Blues','','inherit','closed','closed','','440-revision-v1','','','2019-04-09 10:18:34','2019-04-09 14:18:34','',440,'https://telethon.wruw.org/440-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3867,73,'2019-04-09 10:25:51','2019-04-09 14:25:51','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks for being a loyal listener to the Aging Hipster Blues radio program!<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calling all hipsters past and present—Please help me reach my goal of $500 this year. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your donations go to help pay for equipment upgrades, music purchases and general maintenance of the transmitter tower &amp; equipment to broadcast 24/7!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I have 2 great premiums that are sure to be snatched up quickly BUT there’s a bunch of awesome premiums with WRUW logo items like sweatshirts, t-shirts, hats and even CDs of the music you hear on the program. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So much stuff that I am sure you’ll find something that interests you for a premium we give to you as a ‘thank you’ for your donation. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Aging Hipster Blues','','inherit','closed','closed','','440-revision-v1','','','2019-04-09 10:25:51','2019-04-09 14:25:51','',440,'https://telethon.wruw.org/440-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3868,73,'2019-04-09 10:25:52','2019-04-09 14:25:52','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks for being a loyal listener to the Aging Hipster Blues radio program!<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calling all hipsters past and present—Please help me reach my goal of $500 this year. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your donations go to help pay for equipment upgrades, music purchases and general maintenance of the transmitter tower &amp; equipment to broadcast 24/7!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I have 2 great premiums that are sure to be snatched up quickly BUT there’s a bunch of awesome premiums with WRUW logo items like sweatshirts, t-shir