er&#038;p=4114',0,'shop_order','',1),(4117,1,'2019-04-10 13:43:49','2019-04-10 17:43:49','','Order &ndash; April 10, 2019 @ 01:43 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_NVP5PVMnXUp2E','order-apr-10-2019-0543-pm','','','2019-04-10 13:45:31','2019-04-10 17:45:31','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=4117',0,'shop_order','',3),(4119,1,'2019-04-10 13:57:28','2019-04-10 17:57:28','','Order &ndash; April 10, 2019 @ 01:57 PM','air time ivys red sweater','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_6CYgyySBn0evN','order-apr-10-2019-0557-pm','','','2019-04-10 13:59:45','2019-04-10 17:59:45','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=4119',0,'shop_order','',2),(4121,15,'2019-04-10 13:59:10','2019-04-10 17:59:10','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi Everyone, welcome to my page!  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once again, it\'s the one time of year where we ask our listeners and friends to support our all volunteer community radio station, because you are part of the community we broadcast to.<br><br>Your donations enable us to update equipment, acquire new music, and put on special events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But when you donate, you show your appreciation for the radio programs, and provide valuable feedback so I know that my program and other programs on the station matter to you.  If WRUW and Chasing Infinity are important to you, and I hope that they are,  I also hope you will donate to our the 2019 telethon.  And while you\'re here, pick yourself up some WRUW swag to add to your swag collection.  Thank you for you support, I appreciate it greatly!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Chasing Infinity','','inherit','closed','closed','','450-revision-v1','','','2019-04-10 13:59:10','2019-04-10 17:59:10','',450,'https://telethon.wruw.org/450-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(4125,15,'2019-04-10 14:12:25','2019-04-10 18:12:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi Everyone, I\'m Ed, welcome to my 2019 Telethon page for Chasing Infinity!  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once again, it\'s the one time of year where we ask our listeners and friends to support our all volunteer community radio station, because you are part of the community we broadcast to.<br><br>Your donations enable us to update equipment, acquire new music, and put on special events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But when you donate, you show your appreciation for the radio programs, and provide valuable feedback so I know that my program and other programs on the station matter to you.  If WRUW and Chasing Infinity are important to you, and I hope that they are,  I also hope you will donate to our the 2019 telethon.  And while you\'re here, pick yourself up some WRUW swag to add to your swag collection.  Thank you for you support, I appreciate it greatly!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Chasing Infinity','','inherit','closed','closed','','450-revision-v1','','','2019-04-10 14:12:25','2019-04-10 18:12:25','',450,'https://telethon.wruw.org/450-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(4127,1,'2019-04-10 14:14:29','2019-04-10 18:14:29','','Order &ndash; April 10, 2019 @ 02:14 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_tipbaK5U8uIDh','order-apr-10-2019-0614-pm','','','2019-04-10 14:15:10','2019-04-10 18:15:10','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=4127',0,'shop_order','',2),(4135,67,'2019-04-10 15:08:21','2019-04-10 19:08:21','','wruwtelethon2','','inherit','closed','closed','','wruwtelethon2','','','2019-04-10 15:08:21','2019-04-10 19:08:21','',490,'https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/wruwtelethon2.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(4136,67,'2019-04-10 15:09:42','2019-04-10 19:09:42','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Passport Radio | Featuring The Finest In Downbeat &amp; Dub!</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2584} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/newpassportlogo3g-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2584\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Est. 2003. ​The premier \"Downtempo\" radio program broadcasting Saturdays on WRUW 91.1FM with host Architektur. ​Passport features carefully crafted programming….a deep, fluid soundtrack to complement your life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Passport plays: Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister, Gotan Project, Massive Attack, Sofa Surfers, Thievery Corporation, Yonderboi, Tosca, Nightmares On Wax, Xploding Plastix, Portishead, and loads of heavy Dub!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Exclusive Premium: Musik For Film</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[bandcamp width=100% height=120 album=573501305 size=large bgcol=333333 linkcol=ffffff tracklist=false artwork=small]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Musik For Film</strong> features \"Downtempo\" from many of the genres premier artists including: Rootz &amp; Zeebo of Thievery Corporation (See-I), Rick Torres of the Supreme Beings Of Leisure and Bitter:Sweet (Lazy), Portishead Trip Hop contemporaries Sin, Jamie Saft of John Zorn\'s Masada, Professor Oz featuring Sugar B of Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister fame, and NuJazz pioneers Xploding Plastix, among 17 heavy hitters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> \"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation on Burning Bowl Records. This cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan…great stuff!!\" <br></p><cite>Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow aligncenter\" data-effect=\"slide\"><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_container swiper-container\"><ul class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_swiper-wrappper swiper-wrapper\"><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-4135\" data-id=\"4135\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/wruwtelethon2.png\"/></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2589\" data-id=\"2589\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Passport_2018c.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Passport Radio ~ Saturdays 2-4PM | 24/7 on WRUW 91.1FM!</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2590\" data-id=\"2590\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chill001.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Est. 2003. ​The premier \"Downtempo\" radio program with host Architektur. </figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2587\" data-id=\"2587\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chillinviennasnow1.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation...this cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan...great stuff!!\" Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2591\" data-id=\"2591\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chill002.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"DJ Architektur played the dreamiest, trippiest music I\'d heard in many moons.\" Stephen MacMillan Moser | Austin Chronicle</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2612\" data-id=\"2612\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/newpassportlogo4b.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"We luxuriated in the European-style blends...Drinks. Chats. Downbeats. Exhilarating!\" ​Michael Barnes | Austin Statesman</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2586\" data-id=\"2586\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/MA19.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">​Passport features carefully crafted programming...a deep, fluid soundtrack to complement your life.</figcaption></figure></li></ul><a class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-prev swiper-button-prev swiper-button-white\" role=\"button\"></a><a class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-next swiper-button-next swiper-button-white\" role=\"button\"></a><a aria-label=\"Pause Slideshow\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-pause\" role=\"button\"></a><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_pagination swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-white\"></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Playlists, Interviews, More: </strong><a href=\"http://www.loungeproductions.com/passport-radio.html \">http://www.loungeproductions.com/passport-radio.html </a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/youtube {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/LaOe3u2uiME\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-youtube wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/LaOe3u2uiME\n</div><figcaption><strong>Saturdays 2-4PM | 24/7 on WRUW 91.1FM:</strong> <a href=\"https://wruw.org/show/passport/\">https://wruw.org/show/passport/</a></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/youtube -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Many thanks for your support!</p><cite>Architektur</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->','Passport','','inherit','closed','closed','','490-revision-v1','','','2019-04-10 15:09:42','2019-04-10 19:09:42','',490,'https://telethon.wruw.org/490-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(4137,67,'2019-04-10 15:10:49','2019-04-10 19:10:49','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Passport Radio | Featuring The Finest In Downbeat &amp; Dub!</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2584} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/newpassportlogo3g-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2584\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Est. 2003. ​The premier \"Downtempo\" radio program broadcasting Saturdays on WRUW 91.1FM with host Architektur. ​Passport features carefully crafted programming….a deep, fluid soundtrack to complement your life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Passport plays: Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister, Gotan Project, Massive Attack, Sofa Surfers, Thievery Corporation, Yonderboi, Tosca, Nightmares On Wax, Xploding Plastix, Portishead, and loads of heavy Dub!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Exclusive Premium: Musik For Film</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[bandcamp width=100% height=120 album=573501305 size=large bgcol=333333 linkcol=ffffff tracklist=false artwork=small]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Musik For Film</strong> features \"Downtempo\" from many of the genres premier artists including: Rootz &amp; Zeebo of Thievery Corporation (See-I), Rick Torres of the Supreme Beings Of Leisure and Bitter:Sweet (Lazy), Portishead Trip Hop contemporaries Sin, Jamie Saft of John Zorn\'s Masada, Professor Oz featuring Sugar B of Kruder &amp; Dorfmeister fame, and NuJazz pioneers Xploding Plastix, among 17 heavy hitters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> \"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation on Burning Bowl Records. This cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan…great stuff!!\" <br></p><cite>Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow aligncenter\" data-effect=\"slide\"><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_container swiper-container\"><ul class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_swiper-wrappper swiper-wrapper\"><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2589\" data-id=\"2589\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Passport_2018c.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Passport Radio ~ Saturdays 2-4PM | 24/7 on WRUW 91.1FM!</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2590\" data-id=\"2590\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chill001.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Est. 2003. ​The premier \"Downtempo\" radio program with host Architektur. </figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2587\" data-id=\"2587\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chillinviennasnow1.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"Big up to Architektur, the man behind the great \'Musik for Film\' compilation...this cd is a must-have for every downbeat/chilled dub fan...great stuff!!\" Youri van Driessche | FM Brussels</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2591\" data-id=\"2591\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/chill002.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"DJ Architektur played the dreamiest, trippiest music I\'d heard in many moons.\" Stephen MacMillan Moser | Austin Chronicle</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2612\" data-id=\"2612\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/newpassportlogo4b.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">\"We luxuriated in the European-style blends...Drinks. Chats. Downbeats. Exhilarating!\" ​Michael Barnes | Austin Statesman</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-2586\" data-id=\"2586\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/MA19.png\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">​Passport features carefully crafted programming...a deep, fluid soundtrack to complement your life.</figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-4135\" data-id=\"4135\" src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/wruwtelethon2.png\"/></figure></li></ul><a 