2),(4931,23,'2019-04-13 13:18:57','2019-04-13 17:18:57','<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2467} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/miscpatelethon-1024x683.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2467\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s telethon time, and it is Miscellaneous, PA\'s inaugural telethon show!!! Now is the chance to show all the support you\'ve wanted to show over the misc. semesters this show has been over the airwaves. I have enjoyed spending my Saturday afternoons with all of you, and I hope you\'ll help me continue to bring you the best quality broadcasting content I can here on WRUW-FM.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s make it the best Telethon yet! If I reach my goal I may or may not rename my show to Miscellaneous, OH. to represent the land we all know and love. You\'ll have to donate to find out... </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/facebook {\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/MiscPA/\",\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-facebook wp-block-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.facebook.com/MiscPA/\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/facebook -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Miscellaneous, PA.','','inherit','closed','closed','','481-revision-v1','','','2019-04-13 13:18:57','2019-04-13 17:18:57','',481,'https://telethon.wruw.org/481-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(4932,1,'2019-04-13 13:22:26','2019-04-13 17:22:26','','Order &ndash; April 13, 2019 @ 01:22 PM','This donation is for Meryl Johnson\'s \"It\'s About Justice\" program, which I did not spot on your dropdown menu under \"Show (optional)\" --- please make sure Meryl knows about this donation. Thanks!','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_7p1ilnNCABPkE','order-apr-13-2019-0522-pm','','','2019-04-13 13:24:32','2019-04-13 17:24:32','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#0