4 10:09:35','2019-04-14 14:09:35','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calling all hipsters past and present—Please help me reach my goal of $500 this year. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your donations go to help pay for equipment upgrades, music purchases and general maintenance of the transmitter tower &amp; equipment to broadcast 24/7!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There’s a bunch of awesome premiums with WRUW logo items like sweatshirts, t-shirts, hats and even CDs of the music you hear on the program. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So much stuff that I am sure you’ll find something that interests you for a premium; our way of saying ‘thank you’ for your donation. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>THANK YOU for being a loyal listener and for donating to the Aging Hipster Blues radio program!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>-update 4/14-</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Aging Hipster Blues','','inherit','closed','closed','','440-revision-v1','','','2019-04-14 10:09:35','2019-04-14 14:09:35','',440,'https://telethon.wruw.org/440-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(5286,1,'2019-04-14 10:25:37','2019-04-14 14:25:37','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 10:25 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_wgfK95XFnwpvf','order-apr-14-2019-0225-pm','','','2019-04-14 10:28:15','2019-04-14 14:28:15','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5286',0,'shop_order','',2),(5288,1,'2019-04-14 10:28:39','2019-04-14 14:28:39','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 10:28 AM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_SF9Ocxa9BTlNF','order-apr-14-2019-0228-pm','','','2019-04-14 10:31:16','2019-04-14 14:31:16','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5288',0,'shop_order','',2),(5290,1,'2019-04-14 10:30:27','2019-04-14 14:30:27','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 10:30 AM'