 music and movies. Usually my show blends the two by featuring some of my favorite soundtracks from films and tv. Along with a blend of new and old things I like! I love doing my show every week and being able to rant and rave about the things I love! Donate today! I’ll appreciate it forever. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You listeners provide the support WRUW needs, and help us provide the best quality programming we can- just like these two opossums below supporting each other. Be like them, make your donation today!! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3642} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://telethon.wruw.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/baby-opossums.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3642\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Gearing Up to Get Ill','','inherit','closed','closed','','467-revision-v1','','','2019-04-14 18:22:04','2019-04-14 22:22:04','',467,'https://telethon.wruw.org/467-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(5426,1,'2019-04-14 18:22:06','2019-04-14 22:22:06','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 06:22 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_ueX8suo9jrV6r','order-apr-14-2019-1022-pm','','','2019-04-14 18:25:40','2019-04-14 22:25:40','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5426',0,'shop_order','',2),(5428,1,'2019-04-14 18:22:28','2019-04-14 22:22:28','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 06:22 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_1Qa0ZJ7V5g5dL','order-apr-14-2019-1022-pm-2','','','2019-04-14 18:24:22','2019-04-14 22:24:22','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5428',0,'shop_order','',2),(5430,1,'2019-04-14 18:22:43','2019-04-14 22:22:43','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 06:22 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_5sahGZ6qA22SK','order-apr-14-2019-1022-pm-3','','','2019-04-14 18:23:23','2019-04-14 22:23:23','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5430',0,'shop_order','',2),(5432,1,'2019-04-14 18:30: