_MQJIxrjh94Rub','order-apr-15-2019-1247-am','','','2019-04-14 20:50:31','2019-04-15 00:50:31','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5480',0,'shop_order','',2),(5482,1,'2019-04-14 20:54:21','2019-04-15 00:54:21','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 08:54 PM','I will pay on credit card and pick up at the WRUW pickup party on Sat May 4','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_d1I0MBQggehZv','order-apr-15-2019-1254-am','','','2019-04-14 20:57:16','2019-04-15 00:57:16','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5482',0,'shop_order','',3),(5484,1,'2019-04-14 21:00:26','2019-04-15 01:00:26','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 09:00 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_Xt2dnJ4Aq6Zxq','order-apr-15-2019-0100-am','','','2019-04-14 21:03:59','2019-04-15 01:03:59','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5484',0,'shop_order','',2),(5486,14,'2019-04-14 21:02:49','2019-04-15 01:02:49','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi, this is Neal, your host\nof Dare Waves.&nbsp; Dare Waves is one of WRUW’s\nlongest running shows; every week I strive to put on quality programming, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Playing old and new music</li><li>Music from all sources – vinyl (45s, LPs, 12”), CDs,\nmusic from the WRUW digital library, even cassettes</li><li>Music from *my* personal collection – the Dare Waves vault,\nas I like to call it</li><li>Local music as well as national and international\nbands</li><li>Compilations, soundtracks, and tributes</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>51 weeks of the year I am\nhere for *you* – presenting the best program I can, playing your requests,\nhaving numerous ticket giveaways for live concerts, movies, and other special\nevents, and in general trying my best to program the best “Dare Waves” that I\ncan. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the week I need you to be here for me!&nbsp; Please call 216.368.2208 or donate online at telethon.wruw.org (and direct your donation to Dare Waves).&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dare Waves has a bonus for the most generous donor - if *you* make the largest donation to Dare Waves during the show, in addition to the premiums you select, Neal will toss in a pair of tickets for Robyn Hitchcock at the Music Box Supper Club on Wed June  19!!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please support this long-running program “Dare Waves” and let me thank you with a gift (either music or WRUW merchandise that you can’t get anywhere else).&nbsp; Thank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if you have already donated\nto Dare Waves – Thank You!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','DareWaves','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2019-04-14 21:02:49','2019-04-15 01:02:49','',451,'https://telethon.wruw.org/451-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(5487,14,'2019-04-14 21:02:50','2019-04-15 01:02:50','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi, this is Neal, your host\nof Dare Waves.&nbsp; Dare Waves is one of WRUW’s\nlongest running shows; every week I strive to put on quality programming, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Playing old and new music</li><li>Music from all sources – vinyl (45s, LPs, 12”), CDs,\nmusic from the WRUW digital library, even cassettes</li><li>Music from *my* personal collection – the Dare Waves vault,\nas I like to call it</li><li>Local music as well as national and international\nbands</li><li>Compilations, soundtracks, and tributes</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>51 weeks of the year I am\nhere for *you* – presenting the best program I can, playing your requests,\nhaving numerous ticket giveaways for live concerts, movies, and other special\nevents, and in general trying my best to program the best “Dare Waves” that I\ncan. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the week I need you to be here for me!&nbsp; Please call 216.368.2208 or donate online at telethon.wruw.org (and direct your donation to Dare Waves).&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dare Waves has a bonus for the most generous donor - if *you* make the largest donation to Dare Waves during the show, in addition to the premiums you select, Neal will toss in a pair of tickets for Robyn Hitchcock at the Music Box Supper Club on Wed June  19!!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please support this long-running program “Dare Waves” and let me thank you with a gift (either music or WRUW merchandise that you can’t get anywhere else).&nbsp; Thank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if you have already donated\nto Dare Waves – Thank You!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','DareWaves','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2019-04-14 21:02:50','2019-04-15 01:02:50','',451,'https://telethon.wruw.org/451-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(5488,1,'2019-04-14 21:13:44','2019-04-15 01:13:44','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 09:13 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_TAJ8owVpgrtw2','order-apr-15-2019-0113-am','','','2019-04-14 21:15:15','2019-04-15 01:15:15','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5488',0,'shop_order','',2),(5490,1,'2019-04-14 21:25:39','2019-04-15 01:25:39','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 09:25 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_hptwrCuvMe4z8','order-apr-15-2019-0125-am','','','2019-04-14 21:27:17','2019-04-15 01:27:17','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5490',0,'shop_order','',2),(5492,1,'2019-04-14 21:28:40','2019-04-15 01:28:40','','Order &ndash; April 14, 2019 @ 09:28 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','wc_order_rqjpPJaGKydFj','order-apr-15-2019-0128-am','','','2019-04-14 21:29:49','2019-04-15 01:29:49','',0,'https://telethon.wruw.org/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=5492